---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Footer from '@components/nav/Footer.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Accessibility"
  description="Accessibility information for the LLM Tutorial."
  slug="accessibility"
>
  <main id="main-content" class="accessibility-page" role="main">
    <article>
      <p class="eyebrow">Site information</p>
      <h1>Accessibility</h1>
      <p>
        The LLM Tutorial is designed to meet the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 Level AA.
        We test the site&apos;s navigation, search, content, and interactive learning tools with keyboard and
        assistive-technology use in mind.
      </p>

      <h2>Current status</h2>
      <p>
        The documented accessibility audit was last reviewed on July 15, 2026. It reports no known failures
        among the applicable WCAG 2.2 AA success criteria. The audit covers site navigation, contrast, focus,
        responsive reflow, motion preferences, search, and representative textbook widgets.
      </p>

      <h2>Using the site</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Use the first keyboard focus target, <strong>Skip to main content</strong>, to bypass navigation.</li>
        <li>Open curriculum search with <kbd>⌘</kbd>/<kbd>Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>K</kbd>, or press <kbd>/</kbd> outside a text field.</li>
        <li>Interactive widgets support keyboard controls. View selectors that behave as tabs support arrow keys, <kbd>Home</kbd>, and <kbd>End</kbd>.</li>
        <li>Relevant step-by-step visualizers announce the current step as it changes.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Report an accessibility barrier</h2>
      <p>
        If you encounter a problem, please <a href="https://github.com/yidarvin/darvinyi-llm-tutorial/issues/new">open an issue on GitHub</a>
        with the page URL, the assistive technology or browser you used, and a brief description of what happened.
        That information helps us reproduce and fix the problem.
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .accessibility-page {
    max-width: var(--container-prose);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 5rem 1.5rem;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    color: var(--cyan-500);
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  h1 { margin-top: 0; }
  kbd {
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.8em;
    padding: 0.1em 0.35em;
  }
</style>
